// ========================================================================
// Environment - The development environment necessary to target
// Platform, including OS, programming, specification, testing, and
// reasoning toolchains.
//
// @dependencies prelude.cfr platform.cfr
// ========================================================================

// RDE Tools

abstract BuildTool: Software

Ant: BuildTool
Bazel: BuildTool
Cabal: BuildTool
Gradle: BuildTool
Make: BuildTool
Maven: BuildTool
SCons: BuildTool
Stack: BuildTool
cMake: BuildTool
sbt: BuildTool

abstract PackageManagementTool: Software

Homebrew: PackageManagementTool

abstract PlatformTool: Software

Ansible: PlatformTool
Docker: PlatformTool
Kubernetes: PlatformTool
Terraform: PlatformTool

abstract DevSecOpsTool: Software

BitBucket: DevSecOpsTool
CircleCI: DevSecOpsTool
GitHub: DevSecOpsTool
GitLab: DevSecOpsTool
Hudson: DevSecOpsTool
Jenkins: DevSecOpsTool
TeamCity: DevSecOpsTool
TravisCI: DevSecOpsTool

abstract or DevTool

Cameo: DevTool
DOORS: DevTool
Eclipse: DevTool
Emacs: DevTool
Gears: DevTool
IDEA: DevTool
jProfiler: DevTool
MagicDraw: DevTool
Pandoc: DevTool
Rational: DevTool
Sparx: DevTool
SysMLv2PilotImplementation: DevTool
VSCode: DevTool

abstract FormalMethodsTool

Alloy: FormalMethodsTool
CPSA: FormalMethodsTool
CryptoVerif: FormalMethodsTool
Cryptol: FormalMethodsTool
CVC: FormalMethodsTool
FRET: FormalMethodsTool
FStar: FormalMethodsTool
Lando: FormalMethodsTool
ProVerif: FormalMethodsTool
SAL: FormalMethodsTool
SAW: FormalMethodsTool
SPIN: FormalMethodsTool
Tamarin: FormalMethodsTool
Z3: FormalMethodsTool

// RDE Frameworks/Libraries
abstract Framework: Software

jUnit: Framework
QuickCheck: Framework
TestNG: Framework
PropTest: Framework
UVM: Framework

abstract Environment
  software -> Software *
  frameworks -> Framework *

// We provide an unconfigured instance of each core abstract clafer to
// permit the typechecker and instance generator to sanity-check our
// specification for validity and size.  Note that generating this
// unbound instance takes a significant amount of time and generates
// a ton of output.

arbitraryEnvironment: Environment
